# The program of deferred-closure.ir without validate: the same deferred slot
# FORM: AsRead
# RUN: compile
# RUN(PLACED): pipeline CheckPlacement
# OPTIONS: check=validate-back-end references=narrow disable=pass:InlineCalls,pass:SinkAllocations,pass:PromoteEnvironmentsToVariables
# STATISTIC: FieldsDeferringClosures >= 1
# STATISTIC: DeferredClosureSlots >= 1
# CHECK: image not empty
# PLACED: = GetDeferredClosureSlot
# PLACED: [[closure]]: f2 = NewClosure function=f2 allocationSite=2 closureForm=Deferred [isMadeOnDemand]
# PLACED-NEXT: = NewObject {{*}}, [[closure]] layout=L0 fields=[0]
# PROGRAM-OF: deferred-closure.ir
